   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Dear Nimble Users<div><br></div><div>nimbleAPT is now on CRAN <a href=\"https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=nimbleAPT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://CRAN.R-project.org/package%3DnimbleAPT&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792477140017000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3wgAp5HjM43tVjdXxxskn6\">(here)</a>.</div><div>A vignette giving a brief overview of what the package can do can be found <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/nimbleAPT/vignettes/nimbleAPT-vignette.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/nimbleAPT/vignettes/nimbleAPT-vignette.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792477140017000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1uXYhXSc6zg2ifSKxtijjR\">here</a>.</div><div><br></div><div>A new feature in version 1.0.4 is that it is now possible to calculate the WAIC via a method function calculateWAIC. <br><br></div><div>Best regards</div><div>David</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div><br></div><div><br></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Friday, 4 September 2020 at 13:38:21 UTC+2 David Pleydell wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div>Dear nimble users</div><div><br></div><div>Some news concerning the adaptive parallel tempering package. <br></div><div>- The package name has been changed to nimbleAPT.</div><div>- Version 1.0.3 has been released.</div><div>- Minor updates for compatibility with developments in nimble are included.</div><div>- A vignette has been added demonstrating how to sample multi-modal posteriors using APT versions of nimble&#39;s samplers.</div><div>- Installation instructions are available here <a href=\"https://github.com/DRJP/nimbleAPT\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/DRJP/nimbleAPT&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792477140017000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3qzHbfFnUWS0ZZOZu9CLrF\">https://github.com/DRJP/nimbleAPT</a></div><div>- Citation details are available here <a href=\"https://zenodo.org/record/1049549#.X1ImKHVfikA\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://zenodo.org/record/1049549%23.X1ImKHVfikA&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792477140017000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Bm-p3g8NgpZJ_SjZbZPhy\">https://zenodo.org/record/1049549#.X1ImKHVfikA</a><br><br></div><div>Cheers</div><div>David</div><div><br></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Wednesday, 15 November 2017 at 11:51:21 UTC+1 David Pleydell wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>This has already been discussed in the <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/nimble-users/d9QxpgvSovE\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirectur